Spec: Requested workspace resource cleanup

Purpose:
  Reclaim obsolete generated resources without changing active installations or reproducible source inputs.

Must:
  Limit deletion to explicitly inventoried ignored paths under the current workspace; preserve tracked files, linked paths, embedded Git repositories, private identities and current distribution assets.
  Check live processes before removing owned emulator or build outputs; retain toolchains and dependency downloads when their use is uncertain.
  Preserve small manifests and verification logs before removing duplicate payload trees; record exact paths and reclaimed space in ignored artifacts.
  Do not start cross-session coordination or use an external cleaner to execute a rejected operation.
